Redistributable Firmware
========================

This directory contains firmware files required for hardware drivers on PC systems.
These are redistributable linux-firmware blobs licensed under compatible open-source
licenses (GPL, BSD, MIT, or permissive proprietary).

To repopulate from upstream linux-firmware:
  git clone https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git
  cp linux-firmware/rtl_nic/rtl8168*.fw ./

References:
  - linux-firmware: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git
  - Realtek rtl_nic firmware: Licensed under Realtek firmware license (permissive)
